---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'About';
const description = 'About Yashaswi Patel: product management, growth marketing, and a few things outside of work.';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        I work in product management and growth marketing, based in
        Bengaluru. Three years so far, split across a 100-year-old industrial
        company, a five-person D2C startup, and now a global professional
        services firm. The work sits between two things that don't always
        talk to each other: product strategy (roadmaps, backlog
        prioritization, stakeholder alignment) and hands-on performance
        marketing (Meta Ads, SEO, conversion funnels, SQL dashboards).
      </p>

      <p>
        Before any of that I was drawn to painting, crafts, music, poetry,
        and literature. Some of it still shows up in the work: copy that ran
        in Economic Times and Insight Success, creative briefs directed on
        Figma and Canva, influencer video ad scripts.
      </p>

      <h2>Experience</h2>

      <h3>Growth, Grant Thornton US</h3>
      <p class="meta">Dec 2025 - present</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Handle growth for audit, advisory and tax services, including
          stakeholder management.
        </li>
        <li>
          Analyze LinkedIn campaign performance for global B2B audiences:
          CTR, engagement, lead quality.
        </li>
        <li>
          Build dashboards and reports in Adobe Analytics and Excel for the
          marketing and content teams.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led a LinkedIn lead generation campaign that produced around 800
          leads at roughly $60 CPL.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Product Analyst, American Air Filters (EEMEA, CIS &amp; SAARC)</h3>
      <p class="meta">Jan 2024 - Dec 2025</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Drove B2B product marketing and CRM-led lead generation across
          EEMEA and SAARC.
        </li>
        <li>
          Grew website traffic 40% through content, WordPress SEO, and paid
          channels on a ₹5L+ budget.
        </li>
        <li>
          Wrote and placed content including an IAQ research paper and
          articles in Economic Times and Insight Success.
        </li>
        <li>
          Directed agency partners on 10+ monthly posts and events like
          ACREX and CII, briefing creative on Figma and copy on Canva.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built SQL, Excel, and Power BI dashboards to track user behavior,
          campaigns, and sales trends.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Founder's office, Elixir Creations</h3>
      <p class="meta">Nov 2022 - Oct 2023</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Ran D2C and B2C e-commerce and full-funnel acquisition across
          multiple brands.
        </li>
        <li>
          Scaled BookMyPainting to ₹30L in revenue through SEO and
          marketplace optimization, building a 12-agent logistics network.
        </li>
        <li>
          Launched SpeakinEnglishClub and acquired 15,000+ users through Meta
          ads at roughly ₹150 CPA.
        </li>
        <li>
          Ran Meta ad budgets of ₹15K to 2.5L a month, reaching up to 16.6x
          ROAS and onboarding 15,000+ students at ₹150 CPP.
        </li>
        <li>
          Directed website design on Figma, wrote landing page copy, and
          scripted influencer video ads.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built and managed sales teams and automated post-purchase
          journeys, including onboarding and Telegram support.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Projects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>SpeakinEnglishClub</strong> - product and marketing manager
          for an online spoken English academy. Performance marketing,
          content, copywriting, creative direction, customer experience,
          sales.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Etsy Shop Manager</strong> - edited content and vlogs for
          YouTube influencers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Habits Unlooped</strong> - a self-directed project in SQL
          and data visualization.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <p>
        Product and e-commerce: product strategy, category management,
        backlog prioritization, conversion optimization, funnel building,
        on-page and technical SEO.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics and tools: SQL, Power BI, Excel, Google Analytics, Figma,
        Wrike.
      </p>
      <p>
        Performance marketing: Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, YouTube Ads,
        retargeting, A/B testing, ROAS optimization.
      </p>
      <p>
        Content and CRM: copywriting, technical writing, blog strategy, Zoho
        CRM, Salesforce CRM, Marketo (trained).
      </p>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>
        B.Tech in Electronics and Telecommunications, Y.C.C.E. Nagpur
        (2019-2023).
      </p>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yashaswi-patel-6338801b9/"
            >LinkedIn</a
          >
        </li>
        <li><a href="https://medium.com/@patelyashaswi15">Medium</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:patelyashaswi15@gmail.com"
            >patelyashaswi15@gmail.com</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .meta {
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: -0.75rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
